#: data/maps/Route128/scripts.inc:244
msgctxt "Route128_Text_ArchieWhatHappened"
msgid ""
"ARCHIE: What happened…\n"
"What is this wretched scene…\p"
"Did I…make a horrible mistake?$"
msgstr ""
"水梧桐：发生了什么……\n"
"这悲惨的景象是怎么回事……\p"
"难道我……犯下了可怕的错误吗？$"

#: data/maps/Route128/scripts.inc:249
msgctxt "Route128_Text_ArchieIOnlyWanted"
msgid ""
"I…\n"
"I only wanted…$"
msgstr ""
"我……\n"
"我只是想……$"

#: data/maps/Route128/scripts.inc:253
msgctxt "Route128_Text_MaxieDoYouUnderstandNow"
msgid ""
"MAXIE: Do you understand now,\n"
"ARCHIE?\p"
"Do you finally see how disastrous\n"
"your dream turned out to be?\p"
"We have to hurry! We have to do\n"
"something before the situation goes\l"
"completely out of control!$"
msgstr ""
"赤焰松：现在你明白了吗，\n"
"水梧桐？\p"
"你终于看清你的梦想\n"
"带来了多么惨重的灾难了吗？\p"
"我们得赶快！必须在局面\n"
"彻底失控之前想想办法！$"

#: data/maps/Route128/scripts.inc:262
msgctxt "Route128_Text_MaxieResposibilityFallsToArchieAndMe"
msgid ""
"MAXIE: {PLAYER}, don't say anything.\p"
"I know that I have no right to be\n"
"critical of ARCHIE…\p"
"But the way things are now, I doubt\n"
"that we humans will be capable of\l"
"doing anything about it.\p"
"But neither can we stand by and\n"
"just watch helplessly.\p"
"The responsibility for putting an end\n"
"to this falls to ARCHIE and me…$"
msgstr ""
"赤焰松：{PLAYER}，什么都别说。\p"
"我知道我没有资格\n"
"指责水梧桐……\p"
"但是，照现在的情况看，\n"
"我们人类恐怕\l"
"对此无能为力。\p"
"可是，我们也不能\n"
"只是束手旁观。\p"
"结束这一切的责任，\n"
"落在我和水梧桐身上……$"

#: data/maps/Route128/scripts.inc:274
msgctxt "Route128_Text_MaxieThisDefiesBelief"
msgid ""
"MAXIE: This defies belief…\p"
"Those super-ancient POKéMON…\p"
"Their power is unbelievable.\n"
"They've upset the balance of nature…$"
msgstr ""
"赤焰松：真是难以置信……\p"
"那些超古代宝可梦……\p"
"它们的力量超乎想象。\n"
"它们打破了自然的平衡……$"

#: data/maps/Route128/scripts.inc:280
msgctxt "Route128_Text_StevenWhatIsHappening"
msgid ""
"STEVEN: {PLAYER}{KUN}!\n"
"What is happening?$"
msgstr ""
"大吾：{PLAYER}{KUN}！\n"
"发生什么事了？$"

#: data/maps/Route128/scripts.inc:284
msgctxt "Route128_Text_StevenWholeWorldWillDrown"
msgid ""
"This is terrible…\p"
"After the scorching heat wave ended,\n"
"this deluge began.\p"
"If this doesn't stop, all of HOENN…\n"
"No, the whole world will drown.\p"
"This huge rain cloud is spreading\n"
"from above SOOTOPOLIS…\p"
"What in the world is taking place there?\p"
"There's no point arguing here…\n"
"SOOTOPOLIS might provide answers…$"
msgstr ""
"太糟糕了……\p"
"炙热的热浪结束后，\n"
"就开始下起了倾盆大雨。\p"
"如果这样下去，整个丰缘地区……\n"
"不，整个世界都会被淹没。\p"
"这片巨大的雨云\n"
"是从琉璃市上空扩散开来的……\p"
"那里到底发生了什么事？\p"
"在这里争论也没有意义……\n"
"去琉璃市或许能找到答案……$"

#: data/maps/Route128/scripts.inc:296
msgctxt "Route128_Text_StevenImGoingToSootopolis"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER}{KUN}…\n"
"I don't know what you intend to do,\l"
"but don't do anything reckless.\p"
"Okay.\n"
"I'm going to SOOTOPOLIS.$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}{KUN}……\n"
"我不知道你打算做什么，\l"
"但千万不要乱来。\p"
"好了。\n"
"我要去琉璃市了。$"
